{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790280690,"nonce":"dbLi9sW/JYuWasj7OiOq+hx29NU=","title":"Macro interpreter: statics, #if macro members, @:autoBuild, patterns, Reflect/Type, comprehensions","message":"Gaps closed in the macro interpreter and expander (rows: Issue12447, 2982, 5536, 8778, 9366):\n- Macro-time static variables: ClassRegistry keeps a shared static store (`Class.field`), read on first use from the initializer, written by assignment, ++/--, and in-place array methods; `$v{static}` goes through the full evaluator.\n- `#if macro` members: macro registries see user/import files re-parsed with `macro` defined (compilation/sources.rs macro_context_view); the file being compiled keeps its runtime parse. The driver's `source` is already preprocessed, so the view reads the file from disk.\n- Memoization keyed by call SITE, not just name+args: `bump()` twice expanded once (Haxe never memoizes).\n- @:autoBuild: `@:autoBuild(call)` carries the build call and applies transitively to types extending/implementing the declaring type (was: interfaces only, needing a separate @:build, direct `implements` only); the build pass ran only when some class had @:build. Build context carries pack (+ `_Module` for private types); class values print their path.\n- match_pattern: Array, ArrayRest, Object (Expr values present as {expr,pos}), Extractor, Bind, Type, object literals field-by-field; `value.match(pattern)`; array/map comprehensions; named local functions define their name; no-arg haxe.macro enum values (SingleQuotes, OpAdd, ...); `Ref.get()`; map-style get/exists/keys on objects; Array sort(cmp)/reverse/slice/shift/unshift/insert/copy/lastIndexOf; Reflect.field/hasField/fields/setField/compare/callMethod...; Type.getClass/getClassName/getInstanceFields/enumConstructor/enumParameters; builtin static methods as values (`sort(Reflect.compare)`).\n\nStill open: typed-expression API (Context.typeExpr/storeTypedExpr, TypeTools.toComplexType — Issue3914, 4126, 6830), ExprTools.map/toString and the Printer as an interpreted class instance (Issue4121, TestMisc, TestDefaultTypeParameters), string quote kind in CString (Issue1284), missing Context methods (withImports, getLocalImports, registerFileContents, getTypedExpr), `macro class` reification.","files":null}]}